Subject: [PATCH] Add interactive potential-flow simulation to bottom of About
 page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- FlowSimulation.tsx: real 2D potential-flow physics (uniform flow +
  doublet, the classic closed-form solution for flow around a
  cylinder), not a pre-baked animation — velocity field is re-evaluated
  every frame from the obstacle's current position
- Freestream direction is fixed left-to-right; only the cylinder's
  position is interactive, following the cursor with light easing
- ~260 particles advected by the local velocity field, drawn with a
  fading-trail technique (translucent overlay instead of hard clear)
  so they trace out streamlines rather than looking like disconnected
  dots
- Mounted at the bottom of AboutPanel, below the song widget
